('Natural Sciences','natural-sciences','Preparation for foundational and applied science degree admissions.','published','flask-conical','Strengthen scientific concepts, data interpretation and quantitative problem solving.','Subject requirements depend on the selected science discipline and institution.','{"Biological Sciences","Chemistry","Physics","Environmental Science","Biotechnology"}','{"Biology","Chemistry","Physics","Mathematics","English"}','{"Science admission test","University entry test"}','{"Core sciences","Mathematics","Scientific reasoning","English"}','{"Core Sciences":60,"Mathematics":20,"Reasoning":10,"English":10}','10-14 weeks','{"Select a science pathway","Revise subject foundations","Practice data questions","Complete mixed science mocks"}'),
('Social Sciences','social-sciences','Admission preparation for society, behavior and public-policy disciplines.','published','users','Develop reading, writing, reasoning and general-awareness skills.','Applicants should confirm institution-specific academic and subject requirements.','{"Psychology","Sociology","Political Science","International Relations","Public Administration"}','{"English","General Knowledge","Analytical Reasoning"}','{"University aptitude test","Essay or interview assessment"}','{"English comprehension","Current affairs","Analytical reasoning","Essay skills"}','{"English":35,"General Knowledge":30,"Analytical Reasoning":25,"Writing":10}','8-10 weeks','{"Build reading habits","Review core awareness topics","Practice reasoning","Prepare writing responses"}'),
('Architecture','architecture','Balanced aptitude, mathematics and creative assessment preparation.','published','landmark','Prepare for architecture admissions through spatial reasoning, mathematics and drawing aptitude.','Institutions may require mathematics, a portfolio, drawing test or interview; verify directly.','{"Architecture","Interior Design","Urban Planning","Landscape Architecture"}','{"Mathematics","Physics","English","Drawing Aptitude"}','{"Architecture aptitude test","Drawing test","Interview"}','{"Mathematics","Spatial reasoning","Drawing aptitude","English"}','{"Mathematics":30,"Spatial Reasoning":30,"Drawing Aptitude":30,"English":10}','12-16 weeks','{"Review mathematics","Develop observation skills","Practice spatial questions","Prepare portfolio and timed drawings"}'),
('Graduate Admissions','graduate-admissions','Structured quantitative and verbal preparation for postgraduate admissions.','published','graduation-cap','Prepare for graduate-level aptitude tests with quantitative, verbal and analytical practice.','A completed or near-completed undergraduate degree is generally required; verify program-specific criteria.','{"MS & MPhil","MBA","Public Policy","Graduate Research Programs"}','{"Quantitative Reasoning","Verbal Reasoning","Analytical Writing"}','{"Graduate aptitude test","Institutional admission test"}','{"Quantitative reasoning","Verbal reasoning","Analytical reasoning","Writing"}','{"Quantitative Reasoning":35,"Verbal Reasoning":35,"Analytical Reasoning":20,"Writing":10}','8-12 weeks','{"Take a diagnostic","Target weak skill areas","Practice timed sections","Complete full-length mocks"}'),
